---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import { listPosts } from '../lib/posts';
import { PIKOS } from '../consts';

const posts = (await listPosts()).slice(0, 4);
---

<Base>
  <div class="lead">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Alex, a staff software engineer in Seattle. I build product,
      mostly backend these days. I also like the quieter work: writing the
      guide, adding the lint rule, making it so nobody has to ask me how
      something works.
    </p>
    <p>
      On the side I'm building <a href={PIKOS.site}>Pikos</a>, a notes, tasks
      and calendar app that keeps everything on your device. Rust and React
      behind a Tauri shell, no account and no cloud, and
      <a href={PIKOS.repo}>the code is public</a> so you don't have to take my
      word for it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <hr />

  <Section label="Writing">
    <PostList posts={posts} empty="First one is in progress." />
  </Section>

  <hr />

  <Section label="Work">
    <p>
      I'm at <strong>Solace Health</strong>, a healthcare advocacy marketplace,
      where I joined as engineer fifteen. Scheduling, billing, observability,
      and the standards a team leans on instead of leaning on me.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that, four years at <strong>Topia</strong> as the first engineer
      hire, building a browser-based virtual world with spatial audio and video.
      Frontend architecture, then platform.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <blockquote>
    <p>
      He's extremely organized and an underpromise/overdeliver kind of guy. He's
      not a sandbagger, but he is smart and sharp about setting realistic
      expectations.
    </p>
    <cite>Mark Bullard, Founder, BrainSquall</cite>
  </blockquote>
</Base>

<style>
  .lead {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .lead p {
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    line-height: var(--leading-lead);
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.625rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-soft);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  blockquote p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  cite {
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
